Package: CrownScorchTLS
Type: Package
Title: Estimate Crown Scorch from Terrestrial LiDAR Scans
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
  c(
    person("Jeffery", "Cannon", email = "Jeffery.Cannon@jonesctr.org", role = c("aut","cre")),
    person("Andrew", "Whelan", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: This package estimates tree crown scorch from terrestrial lidar scans collected with a RIEGL vz400i. The methods follow those described in Cannon et al. (2025, Fire Ecology 21:71, doi:10.1186/s42408-025-00420-0).
